<title>CHINA: China Jan-May zinc output up 35.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May zinc output up 35.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 574,100 tonnes of zinc in the first five months, up 35.1 percent compared with the same period a year ago, the China Securities newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>China produced 121,500 tonnes of zinc in May alone, it quoted the State Statistical Bureau as saying.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
